SEL: added a Compressed ASCII parser (``peat.modules.sel.sel_cascii``) with message framing, checksum verification, label-driven reports, and ``CAS``, ``CSER``, ``CHISTORY``, and ``ID`` parsing. SER, CSER, history, and CHISTORY events from files, Telnet/serial commands, and the web interface are now parsed by the same code, ``HISTORY.TXT`` is parsed during pulls, and events from different sources are merged.
